.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH transfer 1  "transfer " 
.SH NAME
transfer \- Inspect and control durable transfer jobs
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtransfer\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect and control durable transfer jobs
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
transfer\-info(1)
List durable transfer jobs
.TP
transfer\-remaining(1)
Show configured roots and remaining capacity
.TP
transfer\-root(1)
Add or update a materialization root
.TP
transfer\-enqueue(1)
Enqueue an individually addressable file job
.TP
transfer\-allocate(1)
Allocate queued jobs to configured roots
.TP
transfer\-materialize(1)
Fetch and materialize assigned jobs through the daemon
.TP
transfer\-pause(1)
Pause a transfer job
.TP
transfer\-resume(1)
Resume a paused transfer job
.TP
transfer\-cancel(1)
Cancel a transfer job
.TP
transfer\-retry(1)
Retry a failed transfer job
.TP
transfer\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
